  "concepts.json: nine descKo lines inserted into existing gen_ entries (listed above); nothing reformatted, no concept added.",
  "lang/content/en_us.json and de_de.json: the title, step, hint and finale keys of the 15 trails (old keys of the 15 removed first, so no stale step key is left). German written together with the English and recorded with translate.py adopt --state proofread --refresh.",
